subckt rpodwo_m ( n2 n1 body ) 
parameters l=1u w=1u rsh=rpwo dw=0.068u ptc1=1.28e-3 ptc2=9.43e-7 pvc1=3.68e-5 pvc2=2.45e-4 
+ pt=temp tfac=1.0 + ptc1 * (pt - 25.0) + ptc2 * (pt - 25.0) * (pt - 25) 
 
 
r1 ( n2 nm ) bsource r=rsh * l / (4.0 * (w - dw)) * (1 + pvc1 * abs(v(n2,n1)) 
